        <div class="row"><span class="ic" data-ic="flow"><img src="//sirasculpt.com/cdn/shop/t/5/assets/lip-ic3.jpg?v=125117318030215569021787588320" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="tx"><b>Supports lymphatic flow</b><span>4D micro-massage with every step</span></span></div>
        <div class="row"><span class="ic" data-ic="gentle"><img src="//sirasculpt.com/cdn/shop/t/5/assets/lip-ic4.jpg?v=55851703352826253501787588322" alt="" loading="lazy"></span><span class="tx"><b>Gentle Japanese 4D compression</b><span>Soft on tender, bruise-prone skin</span></span></div>
