          <summary>Common Questions<span class="ch"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></span></summary>
          <div class="bd">
            <b>Will these help my lipedema?</b>They are made for lipedema legs. They do not cure lipedema, but they help you manage the daily symptoms.
            <b>Can I really wear them all day?</b>Yes, that is the whole point. Soft and breathable enough to wear from morning to night.
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="mrev">
        <div class="mrev-h"><b>What women with lipedema say</b>
          <div class="mrev-nav"><button type="button" class="mrev-arrow" onclick="ssMrevScroll(-1)" aria-label="Previous review">‹</button><button type="button" class="mrev-arrow" onclick="ssMrevScroll(1)" aria-label="Next review">›</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mrev-track" id="ssMrevTrack">
          <div class="mrc"><img class="mrc-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/lip_mini_rachel_v2.jpg?v=1788887579" alt="Rachel, 48" loading="lazy"><div class="mrc-body"><div class="rs">★★★★★</div><p>"My prescribed stockings live in a drawer. These go on before the school run and I forget about them. The heavy, full feeling by evening is so much less."</p><div class="mrc-who">Rachel, 48 <span class="vf">✓ Verified buyer</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="mrc"><img class="mrc-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/lip_mini_sophie_v2.jpg?v=1788887579" alt="Sophie, 49" loading="lazy"><div class="mrc-body"><div class="rs">★★★★★</div><p>"Twenty-five years of 'just lose weight.' It was lipedema. These don't fix that, but I can finally wear compression all day without wanting to rip it off."</p><div class="mrc-who">Sophie, 49 <span class="vf">✓ Verified buyer</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="mrc"><img class="mrc-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/lip_mini_julia_v2.jpg?v=1788887579" alt="Julia, 34" loading="lazy"><div class="mrc-body"><div class="rs">★★★★★</div><p>"Ordered expecting to send them back. Eleven days straight now. My calves aren't throbbing when I finally put my feet up."</p><div class="mrc-who">Julia, 34 <span class="vf">✓ Verified buyer</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="mrc"><img class="mrc-photo" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/lip_mini_nadia_v2.jpg?v=1788887579" alt="Nadia, 54" loading="lazy"><div class="mrc-body"><div class="rs">★★★★★</div><p>"Twenty years of hating every pair I was given. This is the one I wear from the morning dog walk to bedtime."</p><div class="mrc-who">Nadia, 54 <span class="vf">✓ Verified buyer</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="ssbb-modal" id="ssSizeModal">
  <div class="box">
    <button class="x" type="button" onclick="ssCloseSize()">×</button>
    <div class="mh"><h3>Find Your Perfect Size</h3><p>Sizes S–5XL · made for full lipedema legs</p></div>
    <div class="tabs"><div class="tab on" data-t="calc" onclick="ssTab(this)">Size Calculator</div><div class="tab" data-t="chart" onclick="ssTab(this)">Size Chart</div></div>
    <div class="pane on calc" data-p="calc">
      <p class="calc-lead">Find your best fit from your body, no tape measure needed.</p>
      <div class="unit-toggle">
        <button type="button" class="ut on" data-unit="imperial" onclick="ssSetUnit('imperial')">Imperial (US)</button>
        <button type="button" class="ut" data-unit="metric" onclick="ssSetUnit('metric')">Metric</button>
      </div>
      <div id="ssAwh">
        <label>Age <span class="hint">Age affects how weight settles in the legs</span></label>
        <input id="ssAge" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 48">
        <label>Weight <span class="unit-w">(lb)</span></label>
        <input id="ssWt" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 170">
        <label>Height</label>
        <div class="h-imperial" id="ssHImp"><input id="ssFt" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="ft"><input id="ssIn" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="in"></div>
        <div id="ssHMet" style="display:none"><input id="ssCm" type="number" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="cm"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="ssHipMode" style="display:none">
        <label>Your hip measurement, widest point <span class="unit-hip">(in)</span></label>
        <input id="ssHip" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 44">
      </div>
      <button class="go" type="button" onclick="ssCalc()">Show my size ›</button>
      <div class="res" id="ssRes"><div class="big" id="ssResSize"></div><div class="sm" id="ssResNote"></div></div>
      <a class="calc-alt" id="ssAltLink" onclick="ssToggleMode()">Know your hip measurement? Enter it instead</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pane chart" data-p="chart">
      <p class="sc-note">Measure your natural waist and the widest part of your hips. Between sizes? Size up.</p>
      <div class="sc-wrap">
        <table class="sc"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>US Dress</th><th>Waist (in)</th><th>Hips (in)</th><th>Inseam (in)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>S</td><td>4–6</td><td>24–28</td><td>34–38</td><td>31.5</td></tr><tr><td>M</td><td>8–10</td><td>28–32</td><td>38–42</td><td>32.5</td></tr><tr><td>L</td><td>12–14</td><td>32–36</td><td>42–46</td><td>33</td></tr><tr><td>XL</td><td>16–18</td><td>36–40</td><td>46–50</td><td>34</td></tr><tr><td>2XL</td><td>20–22</td><td>40–44</td><td>50–53</td><td>34.5</td></tr><tr><td>3XL</td><td>24–26</td><td>44–47</td><td>53–56</td><td>35.5</td></tr><tr><td>4XL</td><td>28–30</td><td>47–50</td><td>56–58</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>5XL</td><td>32–34</td><td>50–52</td><td>58–61</td><td>36.5</td></tr></tbody></table>
      </div>
      <p class="sc-foot">If unsure, size up for all-day comfort.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
window.SS_V = {
{%- for v in p.variants -%}
  {{ v.option1 | default: 'Default Title' | json }}: {id:{{ v.id }},av:{{ v.available | json }}},
  {{ v.option1 | append: '||' | append: v.option2 | json }}: {id:{{ v.id }},av:{{ v.available | json }}},
{%- endfor -%}
};
window.SS_FALLBACK_ID = {% if current %}{{ current.id }}{% else %}null{% endif %};
window.SS_COLORS = ["Black","Slate Grey","Burgundy","Mocha Brown","Royal Blue"];
window.SS_SIZES = ["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL","5XL"];
window.SS_UNIT = 6495; window.SS_CMP = 10995;
window.SS_THUMB = "//sirasculpt.com/cdn/shop/t/5/assets/slp1-product-black.jpg?v=113408777299575080561787071138";
window.SS_IMG = {
  "Black":"//sirasculpt.com/cdn/shop/t/5/assets/slp1-product-black.jpg?v=113408777299575080561787071138",
  "Mocha Brown":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/ss_prod_mocha.png?width=180",
  "Slate Grey":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/ss_prod_slate.png?width=180",
  "Royal Blue":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/ss_prod_royalblue.png?width=180",
  "Burgundy":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0927/1246/8796/files/ss_prod_burgundy.png?width=180"
};
(function(){
  var thumbs = document.getElementById('ssgThumbs');
  var main = document.getElementById('ssgMain');
  if(thumbs && main){
    var btns = thumbs.querySelectorAll('.ssg__th');
    window._ssgI = 0;
    function show(i){
      if(!btns.length) return;
      if(i < 0) i = btns.length - 1;
      if(i >= btns.length) i = 0;
      window._ssgI = i;
      btns.forEach(function(b,n){ b.classList.toggle('on', n===i); });
      main.src = btns[i].getAttribute('data-src');
      try {
        var tr = thumbs.getBoundingClientRect();
        var br = btns[i].getBoundingClientRect();
        thumbs.scrollLeft += (br.left + br.right)/2 - (tr.left + tr.right)/2;
      } catch(e){}
    }
    thumbs.addEventListener('click', function(e){
      var b = e.target.closest('.ssg__th'); if(!b) return;
      show([].indexOf.call(btns, b));
    });
    var prev = document.querySelector('.ssg__arr--l');
    var next = document.querySelector('.ssg__arr--r');
    if(prev) prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ show(window._ssgI - 1); });
    if(next) next.addEventListener('click', function(){ show(window._ssgI + 1); });
    window.ssShowColor = function(c){
      var map = {Black:12,'Slate Grey':13,Burgundy:14,'Mocha Brown':15,'Royal Blue':16};
      if(map[c] != null) show(map[c]);
    };
  }
  var money = function(c){ return '$' + (c/100).toFixed(2); };
  function colorOpts(sel){ return '<option value="">Color</option>' + window.SS_COLORS.map(function(c){ return '<option'+(c==sel?' selected':'')+'>'+c+'</option>'; }).join(''); }
  function sizeOpts(sel){ return '<option value="">Size</option>' + window.SS_SIZES.map(function(s){ return '<option'+(s==sel?' selected':'')+'>'+s+'</option>'; }).join(''); }
  function thumbFor(c){ return (c && window.SS_IMG && window.SS_IMG[c]) ? window.SS_IMG[c] : window.SS_THUMB; }
  document.querySelectorAll('#ssTiers .tier').forEach(function(t){
    var q = parseInt(t.dataset.qty, 10);
    var e = {1:{n:6495,w:10995},2:{n:6495,w:21990},3:{n:8995,w:32985}}[q] || {n:window.SS_UNIT*q,w:window.SS_CMP*q};
    var nowEl = t.querySelector('[data-now]'); var wasEl = t.querySelector('[data-was]');
    if(nowEl) nowEl.textContent = money(e.n);
    if(wasEl) wasEl.textContent = money(e.w);
    var picks = t.querySelector('.picks'); if(!picks) return;
    var html = '';
    for(var i=1;i<=q;i++){ html += '<div class="pk"><span class="lab">#'+i+'</span><img class="pk-th" src="'+window.SS_THUMB+'" alt="" loading="lazy"><select class="c">'+colorOpts('')+'</select><select class="s">'+sizeOpts('')+'</select></div>'; }
    picks.innerHTML = html;
    picks.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });
    picks.addEventListener('mousedown', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });
    picks.querySelectorAll('.pk').forEach(function(pk){
      var cs = pk.querySelector('.c'), ss = pk.querySelector('.s'), th = pk.querySelector('.pk-th');
      cs.addEventListener('change', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); cs.classList.remove('err'); th.src = thumbFor(cs.value); if(window.ssShowColor) window.ssShowColor(cs.value); });
      ss.addEventListener('change', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); ss.classList.remove('err'); });
      cs.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });
      ss.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });
    });
  });
  window.ssSel = function(el){ document.querySelectorAll('#ssTiers .tier').forEach(function(t){ t.classList.remove('sel'); }); el.classList.add('sel'); };
  var toast;
  function ssToast(msg){
    if(!toast){ toast = document.createElement('div'); toast.className = 'ssbb-toast'; toast.innerHTML = '<span></span>'; document.body.appendChild(toast); }
    toast.querySelector('span').textContent = msg;
    toast.classList.add('show');
    clearTimeout(toast._t); toast._t = setTimeout(function(){ toast.classList.remove('show'); }, 3600);
  }
  window.ssAddCart = function(){
    var t = document.querySelector('#ssTiers .tier.sel'); if(!t) return;
    var items = [], missing = false;
    t.querySelectorAll('.pk').forEach(function(pk){
      var cSel = pk.querySelector('.c'), sSel = pk.querySelector('.s');
      var c = cSel.value, s = sSel.value;
      if(!c){ cSel.classList.add('err'); missing = true; }
      if(!s){ sSel.classList.add('err'); missing = true; }
      if(!c || !s) return;
      var v = window.SS_V[c+'||'+s] || window.SS_V[c] || window.SS_V['Default Title||'];
      var id = v && v.id ? v.id : window.SS_FALLBACK_ID;
      if(id) items.push({id:id, quantity:1}); else { sSel.classList.add('err'); missing = true; }
    });
    if(missing || !items.length){ ssToast('Please choose a color and size for each legging.'); return; }
    var btn = document.getElementById('ssAtc'); var lab = document.getElementById('ssAtcLabel');
    lab.textContent = 'Adding…'; btn.disabled = true;
    fetch('/cart/add.js', {method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'}, body:JSON.stringify({items:items})})
      .then(function(r){ if(!r.ok) throw 0; return r.json(); })
      .then(function(){ lab.textContent = 'Added ✓'; btn.disabled = false; setTimeout(function(){ lab.textContent = 'Add to Cart'; }, 1600); if(window.SiraCartDrawer){ window.SiraCartDrawer.open(); } else { window.location.href = '/cart'; } })
      .catch(function(){ lab.textContent = 'Add to Cart'; btn.disabled = false; ssToast('Something went wrong, please try again.'); });
  };
  window.ssOpenSize = function(){ var m = document.getElementById('ssSizeModal'); if(m && m.parentNode !== document.body) document.body.appendChild(m); m.classList.add('open'); document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden'; };
  window.ssCloseSize = function(){ document.getElementById('ssSizeModal').classList.remove('open'); document.body.style.overflow = ''; };
  var modal = document.getElementById('ssSizeModal');
  if(modal) modal.addEventListener('click', function(e){ if(e.target === this) ssCloseSize(); });
  window.ssTab = function(el){ document.querySelectorAll('#ssSizeModal .tab').forEach(function(t){ t.classList.remove('on'); }); el.classList.add('on'); var p = el.dataset.t; document.querySelectorAll('#ssSizeModal .pane').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.toggle('on', x.dataset.p === p); }); };
  window.ssUnit = 'imperial'; window.ssMode = 'awh';
  window.ssSetUnit = function(u){
    window.ssUnit = u;
    document.querySelectorAll('#ssSizeModal .ut').forEach(function(x){ x.classList.toggle('on', x.dataset.unit === u); });
    var w = document.querySelector('#ssSizeModal .unit-w'); if(w) w.textContent = u === 'imperial' ? '(lb)' : '(kg)';
    var h = document.querySelector('#ssSizeModal .unit-hip'); if(h) h.textContent = u === 'imperial' ? '(in)' : '(cm)';
    document.getElementById('ssHImp').style.display = u === 'imperial' ? 'flex' : 'none';
    document.getElementById('ssHMet').style.display = u === 'imperial' ? 'none' : 'block';
  };
  window.ssToggleMode = function(){
    window.ssMode = window.ssMode === 'awh' ? 'hip' : 'awh';
    document.getElementById('ssAwh').style.display = window.ssMode === 'awh' ? 'block' : 'none';
    document.getElementById('ssHipMode').style.display = window.ssMode === 'hip' ? 'block' : 'none';
    document.getElementById('ssAltLink').textContent = window.ssMode === 'awh' ? 'Know your hip measurement? Enter it instead' : 'Use age, weight & height instead';
  };
  function ssBand(hip_in){ var b = [[38,'S'],[42,'M'],[46,'L'],[50,'XL'],[53,'2XL'],[56,'3XL'],[58,'4XL'],[999,'5XL']]; for(var i=0;i<b.length;i++){ if(hip_in < b[i][0]) return b[i][1]; } return '5XL'; }
  window.ssCalc = function(){
    var res = document.getElementById('ssRes'), sz = document.getElementById('ssResSize'), note = document.getElementById('ssResNote');
    function fail(m){ res.classList.add('show'); sz.textContent = '—'; note.textContent = m; }
    if(window.ssMode === 'hip'){
      var hip = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssHip').value);
      if(!hip || hip < 10) return fail('Enter your hip measurement.');
      if(window.ssUnit === 'metric') hip = hip / 2.54;
      res.classList.add('show'); sz.textContent = ssBand(hip);
      note.textContent = 'Based on ' + Math.round(hip) + '" hips. Between sizes? Size up.';
      return;
    }
    var age = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssAge').value);
    var wt = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssWt').value);
    var ht;
    if(window.ssUnit === 'imperial'){
      var ft = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssFt').value) || 0, inch = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssIn').value) || 0;
      ht = (ft * 12 + inch) * 2.54; wt = wt * 0.4536;
    } else { ht = parseFloat(document.getElementById('ssCm').value); }
    if(!age || !wt || !ht || ht < 120) return fail('Please add your age, weight and height.');
    var hip_cm = 0.62 * wt + 0.20 * ht + 20 + Math.max(0, (age - 45)) * 0.15;
    res.classList.add('show'); sz.textContent = ssBand(hip_cm / 2.54);
    note.textContent = 'Your best match based on people like you. Between sizes? Size up.';
  };
  window.ssMrevScroll = function(dir){ var t = document.getElementById('ssMrevTrack'); if(!t) return; var c = t.querySelector('.mrc'); var w = c ? c.offsetWidth + 12 : 280; t.scrollBy({left: dir * w, behavior: 'smooth'}); };
})();
</script>
